obj_id: agentGenerated_RegionalSalesPerformanceAnalysisOverview-4fc7ec6b
liveboard:
  name: agentGenerated_Regional Sales Performance Analysis Overview
  visualizations:
  - id: Viz_1
    viz_guid: 54146ce8-69bc-4716-9e08-c99a9b920f4b
    note_tile:
      html_parsed_string: |-
        Key Drivers:
        • West region dominates with 32% of total sales (725K), while South underperforms at only 17% (392K)
        • Central region has critical 7.9% profit margin vs healthier regions due to excessive 24% average discounting
        • Furniture category bleeding money with -2,871 profit and -1.8% margin from 30% discounts
        • Binders showing severe losses and 62% profit decline from 2023 to 2024

        Recommendations:
        • Reduce discounting in Central region, especially 51% on Binders and 45% on Appliances
        • Investigate and replicate West region's success model in underperforming South region
        • Restructure or discontinue loss-making Furniture sub-categories (Furnishings, Tables, Bookcases)
  - id: Viz_2
    answer:
      name: Total Sales by Region sorted by Sales descending
      tables:
